  "description": "The Swiss Cross Disc blends our deep cyclocross racing heritage with up-to-date geometry and tubing, and as always, the sweet, perfectly balanced ride that Ritchey is known for.\n\nHandmade to Tom Ritchey's exacting standards, the Swiss Cross features heat-treated, triple-butted Ritchey Logic CrMo steel tubing throughout, and a forged and machined head tube with integrated cups for use with drop-in headsets – lighter and stronger than a standard head tube.\n\nA Ritchey WCS Carbon disc cross fork, painted to match, delivers steering precision on the course and comfort on your favorite back roads. The straight carbon steer tube has an optimized layup for stiffness under braking forces without excessive harshness.\n\nOther features include full-length housing stops for use with cable or hydraulic brakes, Ritchey socket dropouts, 135mm rear spacing, room for tires up to 38c (depending on tire and rim manufacturer), and 140/160mm front rotor compatibility and 160mm rear.",
